  "sourceTitle": "Venison Roast",
  "sourceText": "Venison Roast\nBy: Sarah Donnell\nPublished: Friday, December 10, 2010 - 1:02am\n\nIngredients\n\n\n\n\n1 venison roast, deboned\n1 quart mushrooms\n1 pound fresh kielbasa\n1/2 pound bacon\n1 can baked beans\n1/2 cup brown sugar\n2 onions\n1/2 cup water, or wine\n\nPreparation\n\n1 Stuff roast with ingredients. Put bacon on top in roaster pan at 300 degrees for 4 hours.",
